  "content": "<h1>發光礦車</h1><ul>\n<li>基於原始Minecraft礦車的照明效果。</li>\n<li>礦車具有即時動態照明。</li>\n<li>支援自訂渲染配置。</li>\n<li>僅在<strong>客戶端</strong>端進行渲染。</li>\n</ul><h2>載入器</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1385126/description_4aa365ec-9770-4ebb-9179-2c346113ca29.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\"></a></p><h2>環境</h2><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Side-Client only-3c8527\" alt=\"僅限客戶端\"></p><h2>相容性</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>（必要）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>（必要）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>（推薦）</li>\n</ul><h2>進度</h2><p>請在此查看最新的開發進度。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.windysky.top%252fdocs%252fminecraft-java-edition%252fglowing-minecart%252fversion\" rel=\"nofollow\">開發進度</a></p><h2>圖庫</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/71fe035fe609c517ad449ee953d197e4a23ffc52.png\" alt=\"大圖\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/03f0f6256cb5b401cb123a529221484a416d561a_0.webp\" alt=\"配置畫面\"></p>",
